* For Naphthalene:
    * m = 0.5126 g
  M = 128.17 g/mol
  ΔT = 0.402 °C
  V = 50 g
* For Unknown Sololute:
    * m = 00.6216 g
  ΔT = 0.647 °C
  V = 50 g

