$$ = \frac{8}{3} + 4 + \frac{1}{3} + 2 $$
$$ = \frac{8}{3} + \frac{1}{3} + 4 + 2 $$
$$ = \frac{9}{3} + 6 $$
$$ = 3 + 6 $$
$$ = 9 $$
Therefore, the definite integral is 9.

