   $$\frac{\partial S}{ \partial t} = \frac{Q}{T} = \frac{F_{\text{fr}} v}{T}$$
   Therefore, the entropy rate is:
   $$\Delta S/ \Delta T = \frac{Q}{T} = \frac{F_{\text{fr}} v}{T}$$

4. **Final Equation:**
   The entropy rate is:
   $$\Delta S/ \Delta T = \frac{F_{\text{fr}} v}{T}$$

